      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree on the malicious things with custom clients but mostly every client is behind a pay wall at least as far i know.\nAnd to be honest i use one myself but only to save more avatars i like from public avatar world and for dynamic bones interactions wich i think is needed to be a feature to be honest. \nBut also have a module to prevent certain crashers activities on like portals that spawn inside you where only ya either click on the pop-up menu \"yes\" or \"no\" to decide when ya want to use the portal.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-02-03T18:25:08.780Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Let’s all get realistic. Some players use custom clients and mods. Although I don’t see anything wrong with mods when used responsibly, custom clients seems to be fundamentally counter-integral to the game. I believe there should be a means to prevent or find some sort of protection from the use of malicious custom clients; perhaps a means in which to register or at least be a trusted user to use custom clients for VRChat if it were to be allowed. Most malicious activities I have encountered were mostly due to custom clients. There has to be a way to prevent malicious activity with the use of custom clients. It's the second time i have been turned into a crash avatar, way too many times people turn off collision in a world, and way too many time I get crashed by my IP getting used. ",
